old 64%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (13 sales, net $1.8M sold).","The share count has grown 7.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 435 employees, each generates about $671K of revenue, 1.8x the Healthcare median, and revenue has grown 55.8% a year across its filed history.","CEO pay is $1.4M (2x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (8/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $51K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":26.2222,"ev_ebitda":15.54,"pfcf":23.7593,"pb":3.4965,"roic":-0.1287,"gross_margin":0.5566,"fcf_margin":0.0222,"div_yield":0.0136}},"ticker":"XERS","date":"2026-11-13"}